      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Bike transportation in Kendujhar has evolved into a highly regulated logistics operation that combines robust mechanical safeguards with seamless multimodal booking platforms. The core of the system is the specialized enclosed hydraulic ramp carrier, a purpose‑built chassis that lowers a hydraulic ramp to load a motorcycle within a sealed, weather‑proof enclosure.</p>
